RULES='ALL human characters are ADULTS. Exaone is a twenty-year-old MAN. Preserve EXACT reference hair color, hairstyle, accessories and outfit. Existing Grok outfit coverage is intentional; nonsexual pose. NO TEXT anywhere: no words, letters, numbers, readable writing, logos, trademarks, watermark, panels or captions. Any screens show abstract color shapes only; papers use illegible flowing ink lines. A logout button is a rounded button bearing ONLY a door/exit or power pictogram. Never draw the player face or body: use first-person passenger/viewer POV, at most an anonymous hand or sleeve when scene action requires it. '
CG='ONE full-bleed wide16:9 story CG target1600x900 RGB. Complete scene from top to bottom, full-bleed composition. No reserved dialogue zone, foreground template band or generic table stripe. '
